				Hdt.
				1.174
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόκκος Κ., ὁ</span>, <i>berry of the shrub</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνέωρον</span> (<i>Daphne Gnidium</i>),
