				<u>HP</u>
				9.20.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.172
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κνίδιον</span></b> , τό, a measure of wine, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				150
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
